        <article data-uid="GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService">
  
  
  <h1 id="GameFramework_Services_ConsoleService" data-uid="GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService" class="text-break">
    Class ConsoleService
    
  </h1>
  
  <div class="facts text-secondary">
    <dl><dt>Namespace</dt><dd><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.Services.html">GameFramework.Services</a></dd></dl>
    <dl><dt>Assembly</dt><dd>cs.temp.dll.dll</dd></dl>
  </div>
  
  <div class="markdown summary"><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="2">Service that orchestrates the debug console system using dependency injection.</p>
<p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="4" sourceendlinenumber="4">Architecture:</p>
<ul sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="5" sourceendlinenumber="8">
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="5" sourceendlinenumber="5">Manages console state (open/closed)</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="6" sourceendlinenumber="6">Provides public API for other systems to interact with console</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="7" sourceendlinenumber="7">Respects debug settings from configuration</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="8" sourceendlinenumber="8">Input conflict management is handled by ConsoleInputHandler</li>
</ul>
<p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="10" sourceendlinenumber="10">Flow:</p>
<ol sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="11" sourceendlinenumber="15">
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="11" sourceendlinenumber="11">Receives toggle input events from InputManager</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="12" sourceendlinenumber="12">Checks if console is enabled in debug settings</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="13" sourceendlinenumber="13">Updates console open/closed state only if enabled</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="14" sourceendlinenumber="14">ConsoleInputHandler automatically manages input conflicts by checking IsConsoleOpen()</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.ConsoleService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="15" sourceendlinenumber="15">Delegates UI updates to ConsoleGUI via Console static class</li>
</ol>
</div>
  <div class="markdown conceptual"></div>

